    <string name="voice_model_body_required">Anushtanam scores your recitation entirely on your device using the Hindi voice model. It isn\'t installed yet, so Practice and Recitation can\'t run. Install it once to use them fully offline — no internet needed afterwards, and no transient errors.</string>
