    <string name="voice_model_step_1">1. Open your phone\'s Settings app.</string>
    <string name="voice_model_step_2">2. Go to System → Languages &amp; input → On-device speech recognition. (On some phones: General management → Voice input, or Settings → Apps → Speech Recognition &amp; Synthesis.)</string>
